    value: "10.5281/zenodo.20588214"
    description: "Archived snapshot of version 0.0.1"
keywords:
  - linear stability theory
  - boundary-layer transition
  - hypersonic
  - compressible flow
  - Mack mode
  - second mode
  - Orr-Sommerfeld
  - neutral curve
  - N-factor
